#, java-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"{0}\"><h2>Support FrostWire Today</h2></a><br>The FrostWire "
"installer features no bundled offers or advertisement and you can download "
"it for free. You can help support the continued development of FrostWire "
"with your <a href=\"{0}\">donations</a>.<br><br>You can donate via:"
